    "finalPromptText": "Thanks. I'm deciding whether to keep Molecular Biology of the Cell (Alberts et al., 7th ed., 2022) as my primary text or switch to Lodish. Could you give me a summary of how the book is structured — major parts, chapter organization, and what topics it covers?",
