    "finalPromptText": "I'm particularly interested in how Alberts et al. handle signal transduction in Molecular Biology of the Cell (7th ed., 2022). Is there a way to locate the relevant chapters or sections online, maybe through the publisher or an institutional access point? I want to compare their treatment against my current lecture notes.",
